Make game go fast

[h3]Setup[/h3]
[olist]
[*]Start Oxygen Not Included from Steam as usual.
[*]Click [b]Copy[/b] when Moono asks. This copies Moono's launch options.
[*]In Steam, right-click Oxygen Not Included → [b]Properties[/b] → [b]Launch Options[/b] and paste.
[*]Restart the game.
[/olist]

[b]macOS:[/b] not supported (yet).

[b]Uninstall:[/b] clear Oxygen Not Included's launch options in Steam, then delete [i]%LOCALAPPDATA%\oni-moono[/i].

